        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This way of introducing unfamiliar terms works even for prose intended for professional readers. In this next passage, from the New England Journal of Medicine, the writer deliberately uses metadiscourse (italicized) just to put the new technical term at the end:",
